        <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:middot/9">
          <tei:p>9. Whatever is first implied in a general law and afterwards specified to add another provision similar to the general law, is specified in order to alleviate, and not to increase, the severity of that particular provision.</tei:p>
